{"w":2400,"h":3396,"lines":[{"h":0.016861183202449226,"y":0.032993826972044005,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.11956972757975259,"x":0.065729539415707638},{"t":"AMY:","x":0.065843622208483027,"y":0.082848837007910903,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186199,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"t":"JAKE:","x":0.067901233803556588,"y":0.11482558129275489,"w":0.039094651540120443,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186199,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.12936046497544962,"x":0.065843622015581804,"t":"AMY:"},{"w":0.039094648361206075,"x":0.067901235563665036,"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","y":0.15988372074268387,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"y":0.17587209288242645,"t":"AMY:","w":0.037037035624186199,"x":0.067901235171446001},{"x":0.067901234019107998,"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.19186046499807352,"c":1,"t":"JAKE.","w":0.041152264277140305},{"h":0.0087209303892965551,"t":"AMY.","x":0.06995884812431806,"c":1,"y":0.20784883710528335,"w":0.034979422887166337},{"y":0.22093023235674814,"w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1,"x":0.067901234486747064,"t":"JAKE:","h":0.011627907185728592},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.25290697655663741,"c":1,"t":"AMY:","x":0.067901235563665036,"w":0.039094648361206075},{"w":0.043209877014160153,"y":0.2979651160292287,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"JAKE:","x":0.06790123466678824,"c":1},{"x":0.069958848890384617,"t":"AMY:","y":0.35901162818755117,"w":0.039094648361206061,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"JAKE:","x":0.069958847717002587,"y":0.43749999984265364,"c":1,"w":0.045267489751180015},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"x":0.072016461756402347,"t":"AMY:","y":0.50726744172990201,"c":1,"w":0.039094648361206061},{"w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"JAKE:","y":0.53779069751178676,"x":0.074074073581594457,"c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186199,"c":1,"t":"AMY:","h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.074074074883380137,"y":0.56831395328698064},{"c":1,"x":0.074074073799029444,"w":0.043209877014160153,"t":"JAKE:","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.61482558124613396},{"x":0.074074075116379132,"t":"AMY:","y":0.6453488370079109,"w":0.039094648361206061,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.65971184809570982,"x":0.076028537878777669,"w":0.04341617584228516,"t":"JAKE:","h":0.013425140695380922},{"w":0.039094651540120443,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574,"t":"AMY:","x":0.076131686472738144,"y":0.70784883708794699},{"y":0.72297134441083755,"h":0.0094750913208870857,"x":0.077915303652794698,"t":"JAKE:","c":1,"w":0.041882340113321953},{"c":1,"w":0.039380915959676105,"h":0.010736845126562033,"x":0.075988554412026607,"y":0.73809087969027787,"t":"AMY:"},{"w":0.041152261098225895,"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.76889534861859832,"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","x":0.078189301858294452},{"t":"AMY.","y":0.80087209291763373,"w":0.03497942288716635,"x":0.080246913974369505,"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"x":0.078189299862729406,"y":0.815406976609094,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"w":0.041152264277140277,"t":"JAKE:"},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.83139534866004272,"t":"AMY:","x":0.078189301346660356,"w":0.039094648361206047,"c":1},{"w":0.046125319798787437,"t":"JAKE:","h":0.011118729347615375,"x":0.077851425791228709,"y":0.87839952606443394,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186185,"t":"118","y":0.90843023239970644,"x":0.082304527352515949,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"x":0.1643841949477427,"w":0.61568791707356774,"h":0.020590335095588719,"c":1,"t":"Certainly, in some cities bike-sharing has made a big contribution to that. And","y":0.075059951244603185},{"t":"also helped to cut the number of cars on the road significantly.","x":0.16244260905922989,"y":0.0925561311410803,"w":0.49610112508138016,"h":0.016766896377042317,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.013442448367780524,"x":0.81681107487239557,"w":0.076254393259684305,"t":"Q21\/Q22","y":0.089935752541120184},{"w":0.19547325134277344,"x":0.16255144091811946,"y":0.11042402824871056,"t":"Which is the main point.","h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1},{"y":0.12176370932869929,"h":0.017411278049572321,"t":"Exactly. But I'd say it's had less of an impact on noise pollution because there are","x":0.16651841845501433,"w":0.64637690226236977,"c":1},{"x":0.16650639019054039,"y":0.13943062060728151,"h":0.014249439935942632,"t":"still loads of buses and lorries around.","c":1,"w":0.30271883646647135},{"w":0.049382715225219725,"t":"Right.","h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.16460905349850127,"y":0.15697674391008243,"c":1},{"t":"Shall we quickly discuss the recommendations we're going to make?","w":0.54766504923502601,"h":0.017494168523062847,"x":0.16651550534447013,"c":1,"y":0.16821496244269962},{"x":0.16652267538851503,"y":0.18437296698686234,"c":1,"t":"In order to ensure bike-sharing schemes are successful?","w":0.45298472086588537,"h":0.016501736163531344},{"x":0.16277302995655415,"h":0.016480678383116176,"c":1,"w":0.043051598866780616,"y":0.20243721008793247,"t":"Yes."},{"y":0.21247451030222397,"w":0.64452875773111984,"c":1,"h":0.022373118585916729,"x":0.16641497678629624,"t":"OK. Well, while I think it's nice to have really state-of-the art bikes with things like"},{"x":0.16666666987337503,"y":0.23401162775851303,"w":0.39506172180175786,"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1,"t":"GPS, I wouldn't say they re absolutely necessary."},{"t":"But some technical things are really important - like a fully functional app - so","y":0.24491328041219396,"w":0.62177190144856775,"c":1,"x":0.16647556731183225,"h":0.019773301303176116},{"y":0.24418604635559948,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.81893004120966451,"t":"Q23\/Q24","w":0.076131687164306627,"c":1},{"h":0.018586742863919037,"t":"people can make payments and book bikes easily. Places which haven't invested","x":0.16850342500415869,"w":0.64446334838867181,"c":1,"y":0.26004075820923711},{"c":1,"x":0.16460906235994563,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.27906976716589638,"t":"in that have really struggled.","w":0.23251027425130208},{"h":0.019436535200606508,"t":"Good point... Some people say there shouldn't be competing companies offering","w":0.64847295125325521,"x":0.16855863484435835,"c":1,"y":0.29024932254988756},{"c":1,"t":"separate bike-sharing schemes, but in some really big cities, competition's","w":0.59523137410481763,"x":0.16638264420744747,"y":0.30538962436074324,"h":0.023460619581602171},{"h":0.021171716975379451,"t":"beneficial and anyway one company might not be able to manage the whole","x":0.16645733230257539,"w":0.6094996643066406,"y":0.32157314161306805,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.16550729848140402,"h":0.015346593373796291,"w":0.05363372802734373,"t":"thing.","y":0.34178367357902295},{"c":1,"t":"Right. Deciding how much to invest is a big question. Cities which have opened","x":0.16853044755836682,"y":0.35232226821565304,"w":0.63211939493815095,"h":0.020399727164224668},{"c":1,"t":"loads of new bike lanes at the same time as introducing bike-sharing schemes","x":0.1665747295182006,"w":0.62573206583658847,"y":0.36912846316215409,"h":0.016207170430285522},{"c":1,"t":"have generally been more successful - but there are examples of successful","w":0.61156046549479159,"y":0.3827069070642608,"x":0.17055925472986341,"h":0.019664140977623701},{"c":1,"w":0.73084966023763021,"x":0.16853719393060487,"t":"schemes where this hasn't happened... What does matter though - is having a Q23\/Q24","y":0.3978207595640727,"h":0.02127318275550516},{"h":0.013098515666696509,"t":"big publicity campaign.","y":0.42005813940883563,"c":1,"x":0.16872427869608467,"w":0.18724280039469401},{"y":0.42996041330190016,"h":0.019760398055976403,"w":0.61766921997070323,"t":"Definitely. If people don't know how to use the scheme or don't understand its","x":0.17058043573108533,"c":1},{"x":0.17063223297380697,"y":0.44544854365505993,"w":0.61558100382486969,"t":"benefits, they won't use it. People need a lot of persuasion to stop using their","h":0.019170121955646935,"c":1},{"t":"cars.","c":1,"x":0.16872427969473194,"y":0.46802325565792513,"w":0.045267489751180001,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"y":0.49945741765519669,"x":0.17267048096105705,"w":0.60735397338867181,"c":1,"t":"Shall we look at some examples now? And say what we think is good or bad","h":0.018246663613650793},{"y":0.51996932289647069,"x":0.17273910205342977,"t":"about them.","w":0.099042987823486334,"h":0.011509343788677184,"c":1},{"h":0.019253615074921626,"c":1,"t":"I suppose we should start with Amsterdam as this was one of the first cities to","y":0.5292564904936472,"x":0.17064744114448671,"w":0.61965698242187506},{"c":1,"w":0.2345678965250651,"y":0.54941860487723138,"t":"have a bike-sharing scheme.","x":0.170781897622241,"h":0.013081394460653373},{"c":1,"h":0.019213455164249993,"t":"Yes. There was already a strong culture of cycling here. In a way it's strange that","x":0.17066740015097207,"y":0.56179356725760354,"w":0.64637278238932294},{"c":1,"x":0.17064144971237188,"t":"there was such a demand for bike-sharing because you'd have thought most","y":0.57749522307526446,"h":0.018023015753540483,"w":0.61552495320638023},{"x":0.1747740787111193,"t":"people would have used their own bikes.","w":0.32527997334798175,"h":0.014773619329409904,"c":1,"y":0.5942858187550234},{"t":"And yet it's one of the best-used schemes... Dublin's an interesting example of a","y":0.60738086958949378,"c":1,"x":0.17264240424805916,"h":0.020380420033305535,"w":0.64853729248046865},{"y":0.62779740897569503,"h":0.011778563015312216,"t":"success story.","w":0.11316871643066409,"x":0.1748971238062729,"c":1},{"w":0.49416839599609375,"h":0.018661027241090089,"y":0.63918713969094865,"c":1,"x":0.17264640186043342,"t":"It must be because the public transport system's quite limited."},{"y":0.65348350674841904,"x":0.17471166635711285,"w":0.64843897501627601,"h":0.019998534688960845,"t":"Not really - there's no underground, but there are trams and a good bus network.","c":1},{"h":0.019414427704468551,"c":1,"x":0.17264429448347376,"w":0.64235198974609375,"y":0.66863748731831829,"t":"I'd say price has a lot to do with it. It's one of the cheapest schemes in Europe to"},{"x":0.84567901325786576,"h":0.013081394460653373,"t":"Q25","c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.5595930235363884},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.63808139519280882,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"t":"Q26","x":0.84773662611189626},{"c":1,"y":0.70000544339244153,"t":"But the buses are really slow - anyway the weather certainly can't be a factor!","w":0.62181391398111974,"x":0.1747066658758368,"h":0.020614603804193998},{"t":"No - definitely not. The London scheme's been quite successful.","w":0.51673670450846354,"h":0.018428756435290961,"x":0.1747433192817697,"c":1,"y":0.71637277121929233},{"y":0.73062609558872427,"w":0.60532663981119783,"c":1,"h":0.020777286713760779,"x":0.17471035042789046,"t":"Yes - it's been a really good thing for the city. The bikes are popular and the"},{"c":1,"w":0.55991073608398434,"t":"whole system is well maintained but it isn't expanding quickly enough.","x":0.17474417869834991,"y":0.74698269205009649,"h":0.017983177104181625},{"t":"Basically, not enough's been spent on increasing the number of cycle lanes.","c":1,"h":0.019154893495449521,"x":0.17474606240451065,"y":0.76203196366332293,"w":0.60726750691731779},{"y":0.78197674404726558,"t":"Hopefully that ll change.","x":0.17489711907938774,"w":0.19547325134277346,"h":0.014548579711374798,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.1747595138813117,"w":0.30893231709798186,"h":0.016617872689722257,"y":0.79465855795867657,"t":"Yes. Now what about outside Europe?"},{"y":0.80745136394425898,"t":"Well bike-sharing schemes have taken off in places like Buenos Aires.","h":0.020831348477600597,"w":0.56002314249674479,"x":0.17674406083181035,"c":1},{"h":0.021363329129168607,"x":0.17674692119127969,"y":0.82248244746998833,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. They built a huge network of cycle lanes to support the introduction of the","w":0.64031931559244792},{"x":0.17676476897571566,"y":0.83933019342592785,"h":0.020672689197481775,"t":"scheme there, didn't they? It attracted huge numbers of cyclists where previously","w":0.64647384643554684,"c":1},{"w":0.17901234944661459,"c":1,"y":0.86042402841828469,"t":"there were hardly any.","x":0.17901234368985153,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"x":0.17678758631264532,"y":0.87332648807680691,"h":0.016286140055482345,"w":0.24305735270182291,"t":"An example of good planning.","c":1},{"x":0.8497942395130097,"y":0.76017441835628352,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q27"},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q28","y":0.86918604635046959,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.8497942393072484,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.7194745805284799,"y":0.9556315263824986,"w":0.25431531270345054,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.028414039926338064}]}